<title>HONG KONG: JG Summit seen planning Eurobond issue.</title>
<headline>JG Summit seen planning Eurobond issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>JG Summit Holdings plans to launch a Eurobond issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>The fixed-rate bond is expected to be about US$200 million in size and carry a maturity of 5.5 years.</p>
<p>ING Barings is lead manager, they said.</p>
<p>JG Summit Holdings is the diversified holding company of Filipino-Chinese tycoon John Gokongwei.</p>
<p>The company's principal businesses are consumer foods, agro-industrial and food products, garments, real estate development, hotel and service apartment management and banking.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
